<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45346" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stercŏro</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To dung</i>, <i>manure with dung</i>,
				<i>to muck</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">loca,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 38</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Cic. Sen. 15, 54</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">agrum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 3, § 305</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Col. 2, 16, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 17, 9,
				6, § 50</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To cleanse from dung</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">latrinas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					7, 1, 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stercorata colluvies,</span>”
				<i>dungheap</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					1, 6, 24</span></i>
			.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stercŏ-rātus</span></b> , a, um,
				P. a., <i>dunged</i>, <i>mucked</i>, <i>manured</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">locus stercoratissimus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					11, 2, 85</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">2, 11,
		8</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
